{"title":"2006 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d98ffe996c0f0d3b82b284cba2113439fefea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> be an odd integer. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/241e6e35ad6d73fb2ef98244b0211deb2f25222a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b0256a78d58b6d5f7a53400b19e7747d2983fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> be two consecutive vertices of a regular polygon with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> sides. For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/7/c17d88e2fdeef66df0e37def936f39b773567278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76ebaba4ae3d5c911d6e31ad855d502ad88d48a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> as the vertex of the given polygon which is located in the bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22ef7197ce1ba16df8fe62edd9db13dd2ec870ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b5a1c2a4ba22b18983816c303fd23016e534333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />. Find for what values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46fb6e14b75f23c75e04009eaf609b12f03a90c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_0, P_1, P_2,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, runs through all the vertices of the polygon.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2006_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211842\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1761/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.391      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.391      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26323:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211842 and revision id 207470. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}